<title>USA: IMPATH Inc Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>IMPATH Inc Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMPATH Inc.</p>
<p>				  (UNAUDITED)</p>
<p>					   Three months ended March 31</p>
<p>						   1997		 1996</p>
<p> Revenues				 $7,845,000	 $4,742,000</p>
<p> Income before income tax expense  1,015,000	    303,000</p>
<p> Income tax expense			452,000	    135,000</p>
<p> Net Income				  563,000	    168,000</p>
<p>Earnings and pro forma earnings</p>
<p>per common and common equivalent</p>
<p>   shares (1) (2)				.10		  .04</p>
<p>Weighted and pro forma average number</p>
<p>of common and common equivalent</p>
<p>   shares outstanding (2)	    5,754,000	  4,445,000</p>
<p>(1)  Excludes dividends accrued on Preferred Stock which ceased to accrue upon conversion of the Preferred Stock immediately prior to the completion of the Company's initial public offering in February 1996.</p>
<p>(2)  Pro forma weighted average shares outstanding for the three months ended March 31, 1996 gives effect to the conversion of the outstanding shares of Preferred Stock into shares of Common Stock immediately prior to the completion of the Company's initial public offering.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
